      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "With the new GetCurrentCamera method in Udon, I can get the expected resolution when I react to OnWillRenderObject. I can see that the resolution changes only when taking an actual photo. I guess I'm ok with that behaviour. It remains debateable though, if taking a photo should then also trigger an OnVRCCameraSettingsChanged event before and after. And FOV is still wrong in any case...",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
